és","de":"sdd-tasks ist ein Tool, das TDD-Aufgaben aus genehmigten Designs erzeugt, um die Implementierung von Funktionen zu erleichtern","pt":"O sdd-tasks é uma ferramenta que gera tarefas TDD a partir de designs aprovados","ru":"Sdd-tasks - это инструмент, генерирующий задачи TDD из утвержденных дизайнов","ar":"سد-مهام هو أداة تولد مهام TDD من التصاميم المعتمدة"},"features":{"en":["Generates task breakdowns using the /sdd-design command","Verifies design prerequisites with the sdd-status MCP tool","Reviews design documents in .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md format","Creates implementable work items based on approved designs","Utilizes the sdd-approve design MCP tool for design phase approval","Integrates with MCP tools for seamless workflow"],"zh":["生成全面的TDD-based任务分解","支持设计生成和审批","集成MCP工具用于设计审批和任务生成","支持CLI命令用于任务生成和管理","生成设计文档用于参考"],"ja":["TDD-basedタスクブレイクダウンの生成","設計生成と承認のサポート","MCPツールとの統合による設計承認とタスク生成","CLIコマンドによるタスク生成と管理","設計文書の生成"],"ko":["포괄적인 TDD 기반 태스크 분해 생성","설계 생성 및 승인 지원","MCP 툴과 통합하여 설계 승인 및 태스크 생성","CLI 명령어를 통한 태스크 생성 및 관리","설계 문서 생성"],"es":["Generación de tareas TDD detalladas","Verificación de prerequisitos con sdd-status","Integración con el flujo de trabajo de diseño aprobado","Compatibilidad con MCP tools como sdd-approve design","Revisión de documentos de diseño en .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md"],"fr":["Génération de tâches TDD détaillées","Vérification des prérequis avec sdd-status","Intégration avec le flux de travail de conception approuvée","Compatibilité avec les outils MCP tels que sdd-approve design","Révision des documents de conception dans .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md"],"de":["Erzeugung detaillierter TDD-Aufgaben","Überprüfung der Voraussetzungen mit sdd-status","Integration mit dem Workflow genehmigter Designs","Kompatibilität mit MCP-Tools wie sdd-approve design","Überprüfung von Design-Dokumenten in .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md"],"pt":["Geração de tarefas TDD a partir de designs aprovados","Integração com o MCP tool para aprovação de designs","Verificação de pré-requisitos com o sdd-status","Suporte à revisão de designs em .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md"],"ru":["Генерация задач TDD из утвержденных дизайнов","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами и MCP tool для утверждения дизайнов","Проверка предварительных условий с помощью sdd-status","Поддержка рассмотрения дизайнов в .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md"],"ar":["إنشاء مهام TDD من التصاميم المعتمدة","التكامل مع أداة MCP لاعتماد التصاميم","التحقق من الشروط المسبقة باستخدام sdd-status","دعم استعراض التصاميم في .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use sdd-tasks","sdd-tasks setup guide","TDD-based task breakdown generation","sdd-tasks alternative","sdd-tasks vs MCP tools","sdd-tasks install","what is sdd-tasks","sdd-tasks workflow integration","sdd-tasks design phase approval"],"zh":["SDD-Tasks","TDD-based任务分解","设计生成","MCP工具","CLI命令","AI工具","任务管理","设计审批"],"ja":["SDD-Tasks","TDD-basedタスクブレイクダウン","設計生成","MCPツール","CLIコマンド","AIエージェント","タスク管理","設計承認"],"ko":["SDD-Tasks","TDD 기반 태스크 분해","설계 생성","MCP 툴","CLI 명령어","AI 도구","태스크 관리","설계 승인"],"es":["sdd-tasks","tareas TDD","diseño aprobado","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","herramientas de desarrollo","MCP tools","sdd-status","sdd-approve design"],"fr":["sdd-tasks","tâches TDD","conception approuvée","flux de travail de développement","outils de développement","MCP tools","sdd-status","sdd-approve design"],"de":["sdd-tasks","TDD-Aufgaben","genehmigtes Design","Entwicklungsprozess","Entwicklungstools","MCP-Tools","sdd-status","sdd-approve design"],"pt":["sdd-tasks","geração de tarefas TDD","designs aprovados","MCP tool","sdd-status","TDD","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["sdd-tasks","генерация задач TDD","утвержденные дизайны","ИИ Агенты","MCP tool","sdd-status","TDD","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["سد-مهام","إنشاء مهام TDD","التصاميم المعتمدة","أداة MCP","sdd-status","TDD","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"yi-john-huang","repo":"sdd-mcp","repoPath":"yi-john-huang/sdd-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.294Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sdd-tasks","description":"Generate TDD task breakdown for SDD workflow. Use when breaking down design into implementable tasks with test-first approach. Invoked via /sdd-tasks <feature-name>.","bodyPreview":"# SDD Task Breakdown Generation\n\nGenerate comprehensive TDD-based task breakdowns that translate approved designs into implementable work items.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore generating tasks:\n1. Design must be generated using `/sdd-design`\n2. Design phase should be approved (use `sdd-approve design` MCP tool)\n3. Review the design document in `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Verify Prerequisites\n\nUse `sdd-status` MCP tool to verify:\n- `design.generated: true`\n- `design.app","body":"# SDD Task Breakdown Generation\n\nGenerate comprehensive TDD-based task breakdowns that translate approved designs into implementable work items.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore generating tasks:\n1. Design must be generated using `/sdd-design`\n2. Design phase should be approved (use `sdd-approve design` MCP tool)\n3. Review the design document in `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Verify Prerequisites\n\nUse `sdd-status` MCP tool to verify:\n- `design.generated: true`\n- `design.approved: true` (recommended before tasks)\n\n### Step 2: Review Design\n\n1. Read `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`\n2. Identify all components to implement\n3. Note interfaces and data models\n4. Understand dependencies between components\n\n### Step 3: Apply TDD Workflow\n\nFor each task, follow the Red-Green-Refactor cycle:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    TDD CYCLE                                │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                             │\n│   1. RED    ──────>  Write failing test first              │\n│                      (Test describes expected behavior)     │\n│                                                             │\n│   2. GREEN  ──────>  Write minimal code to pass            │\n│                      (Just enough to make test green)       │\n│                                                             │\n│   3. REFACTOR ────>  Clean up, maintain tests passing      │\n│                      (Improve design without breaking)      │\n│                                                             │\n│   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────    │\n│                      REPEAT                                 │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Step 4: Apply Test Pyramid\n\nStructure tests following the 70/20/10 ratio:\n\n```\n                    ╱╲\n                   ╱  ╲\n                  ╱ E2E╲         10% - Critical user journeys\n                 ╱──────╲\n                ╱        ╲\n               ╱Integration╲    20% - Component interactions\n              ╱────────────╲\n             ╱              ╲\n            ╱   Unit Tests   ╲  70% - Individual functions\n           ╱──────────────────╲\n```\n\n| Level | Coverage | Scope | Speed |\n|-------|----------|-------|-------|\n| **Unit** | 70% | Single function/class | Fast (ms) |\n| **Integration** | 20% | Component interactions | Medium (s) |\n| **E2E** | 10% | Full user journeys | Slow (min) |\n\n### Step 5: Generate Task Breakdown\n\nStructure tasks hierarchically:\n\n```markdown\n# Tasks: {Feature Name}\n\n## Overview\n{Summary of implementation approach}\n\n## Task Groups\n\n### 1. {Component/Layer Name}\n\n#### 1.1 {Task Name}\n**Type:** Unit | Integration | E2E\n**Estimated Effort:** S | M | L | XL\n**Dependencies:** {Task IDs}\n\n**TDD Steps:**\n1. RED: Write test for {specific behavior}\n   ```typescript\n   describe(''{Component}'', () => {\n     it(''should {expected behavior}'', () => {\n       // Arrange\n       // Act\n       // Assert\n     });\n   });\n   ```\n2. GREEN: Implement {minimal solution}\n3. REFACTOR: {Specific improvements}\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Test passes\n- [ ] Code coverage >= 80%\n- [ ] No lint errors\n\n#### 1.2 {Next Task}\n...\n\n### 2. {Next Component}\n...\n\n## Implementation Order\n\n```\n[1.1] ──> [1.2] ──> [2.1]\n              │\n              └──> [1.3] ──> [2.2]\n```\n\n## Definition of Done\n- [ ] All tests pass\n- [ ] Code coverage >= 80%\n- [ ] No lint/type errors\n- [ ] Code reviewed\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n```\n\n### Step 6: Task Sizing Guidelines\n\n| Size | Description | Test Count | Time |\n|------|-------------|------------|------|\n| **S** | Single function, 1-2 tests | 1-2 | < 1 hour |\n| **M** | Multiple functions, 3-5 tests | 3-5 | 1-4 hours |\n| **L** | Component with integration | 5-10 | 4-8 hours |\n| **XL** | Complex component, many edge cases | 10+ | 1-2 days |\n\n### Step 7: Test-First Task Template\n\nFor each implementation task:\n\n```markdown\n#### Task {X.Y}: {Task Name}\n\n**Component:** {ComponentName}\n**Type:** Unit Test → Implementation\n\n**Test Scenarios:**\n1. Happy path: {Expected behavior when inputs are valid}\n2. Edge case: {Boundary conditions}\n3. Error case: {Invalid inputs, failures}\n\n**Test Code (RED):**\n```typescript\nimport { {Component} } from ''./{component}'';\n\ndescribe(''{Component}'', () => {\n  describe(''{method}'', () => {\n    it(''should {happy path behavior}'', async () => {\n      // Arrange\n      const input = { /* valid input */ };\n\n      // Act\n      const result = await component.method(input);\n\n      // Assert\n      expect(result).toEqual({ /* expected */ });\n    });\n\n    it(''should throw when {error condition}'', async () => {\n      // Arrange\n      const invalidInput = { /* invalid */ };\n\n      // Act & Assert\n      await expect(component.method(invalidInput))\n        .rejects.toThrow(''{ErrorType}'');\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n**Implementation (GREEN):**\n{Brief description of minimal implementation}\n\n**Refactor:**\n- Extract {helper function} if needed\n- Apply {specific pattern}\n```\n\n### Step 8: Save and Execute\n\n1. Save tasks to `.spec/specs/{feature}/tasks.md`\n2. Use `sdd-approve tasks` MCP tool to mark phase complete\n3. Use `sdd-spec-impl` MCP tool to execute tasks with TDD\n\n## MCP Tool Integration\n\n| Tool | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| `sdd-status` | Verify design phase complete |\n| `sdd-approve` | Mark tasks phase as approved |\n| `sdd-spec-impl` | Execute tasks using TDD methodology |\n| `sdd-quality-check` | Validate code quality during implementation |\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\n- [ ] All design components have corresponding tasks\n- [ ] Tasks follow TDD (test first)\n- [ ] Test pyramid ratio maintained (70/20/10)\n- [ ] Dependencies between tasks are clear\n- [ ] Each task has specific acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Tasks are sized appropriately (avoid XL when possible)\n- [ ] Implementation order respects dependencies\n- [ ] Definition of Done is clear\n\n## Steering Document References\n\nApply these steering documents during task breakdown:\n\n| Document | Purpose | Key Application |\n|----------|---------|-----------------|\n| `.spec/steering/tdd-guideline.md` | Test-Driven Development | Structure all tasks using Red-Green-Refactor cycle, follow test pyramid (70/20/10) |\n\n**Key TDD Principles for Tasks:**\n1. **RED**: Every task starts with writing a failing test\n2. **GREEN**: Implement minimal code to pass the test\n3. **REFACTOR**: Clean up while keeping tests green\n4. **Test Pyramid**: 70% unit, 20% integration, 10% E2E\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Problem | Solution |\n|--------------|---------|----------|\n| **Test After** | Missing edge cases | Always write test first |\n| **Ice Cream Cone** | Too many E2E tests | Follow pyramid (70/20/10) |\n| **Big Tasks** | Hard to track progress | Break into S/M sizes |\n| **No Dependencies** | Blocked work | Map dependencies explicitly |\n| **Vague Criteria** | Unclear completion | Specific, measurable criteria |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:09.092Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated TDD-based task breakdowns from approved design documents.","zh":"适用于需要从批准的设计文档中自动执行TDD基于任务分解的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが承認された設計文書から自動化されたTDDベースのタスク分解が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"승인된 설계 문서에서 자동화된 TDD 기반 태스크 분해가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan descomposiciones de tareas automatizadas basadas en TDD a partir de documentos de diseño aprobados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de décompositions de tâches automatisées basées sur TDD à partir de documents de conception approuvés.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die automatisierte TDD-basierte Aufgabenzerlegung aus genehmigten Designdokumenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de divisões de tarefas automatizadas baseadas em TDD de documentos de design aprovados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы автоматические разбиения задач на основе TDD из утвержденных документов дизайна.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تقسيمات مهام آلية باستخدام مبدأ TDD من وثائق التصميم المعتمدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive task breakdowns using TDD principles, streamlining the development process by creating implementable work items from approved designs in .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md format, leveraging the sdd-design and sdd-approve design tools.","zh":"赋予代理生成全面任务分解的能力，使用TDD原则，通过从批准的设计中创建可实施的工作项（.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md格式）来简化开发流程，利用sdd-design和sdd-approve设计工具。","ja":"エージェントがTDDの原則を使用して包括的なタスク分解を生成できるようにし、承認された設計（.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md形式）から実施可能な作業項目を作成することで開発プロセスを合理化し、sdd-designとsdd-approveデザインツールを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 TDD 원칙을 사용하여 포괄적인 태스크 분해를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 승인된 설계(.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md 형식)에서 구현 가능한 작업 항목을 생성함으로써 개발 프로세스를 간소화하고 sdd-design 및 sdd-approve 설계 도구를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar descomposiciones de tareas exhaustivas utilizando principios de TDD, agilizando el proceso de desarrollo mediante la creación de elementos de trabajo implementables a partir de diseños aprobados en formato .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md, aprovechando las herramientas de diseño sdd-design y sdd-approve.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des décompositions de tâches exhaustives en utilisant les principes de TDD, en rationalisant le processus de développement en créant des éléments de travail implementables à partir de conceptions approuvées au format .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md, en exploitant les outils de conception sdd-design et sdd-approve.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, umfassende Aufgabenzerlegungen unter Verwendung von TDD-Prinzipien zu generieren, den Entwicklungsprozess zu rationalisieren, indem implementierbare Arbeitspunkte aus genehmigten Entwürfen im .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md-Format erstellt werden, die sdd-design- und sdd-approve-Designtools nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar divisões de tarefas abrangentes usando princípios TDD, simplificando o processo de desenvolvimento criando itens de trabalho implementáveis a partir de designs aprovados no formato .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md, aproveitando as ferramentas de design sdd-design e sdd-approve.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать полные разбиения задач на основе принципов TDD, упрощая процесс разработки путем создания реализуемых элементов работы из утвержденных дизайнов в формате .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md, используя инструменты дизайна sdd-design и sdd-approve.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تقسيمات شاملة للمهام باستخدام مبادئ TDD، وتبسيط عملية التطوير من خلال إنشاء عناصر قابلة للتنفيذ من التصاميم المعتمدة في تنسيق .spec/specs/{feature}/design.md، واستخدام أدوات التصميم sdd-design و sdd-approve."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task generation from approved design documents","Streamlining development workflows with TDD-based task breakdowns","Creating implementable work items for project managers and developers"],"zh":["从批准的设计文档中自动化任务生成","使用TDD基于任务分解来简化开发工作流程","为项目经理和开发人员创建可实施的工作项"],"ja":["承認された設計文書からのタスク自動生成","TDDベースのタスク分解を使用した開発ワークフローの合理化","プロジェクトマネージャーと開発者向けの実施可能な作業項目の作成"],"ko":["승인된 설계 문서에서 태스크 자동 생성","TDD 기반 태스크 분해를 사용한 개발 워크플로우의 간소화","프로젝트 관리자 및 개발자向け의 구현 가능한 작업 항목 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de tareas a partir de documentos de diseño aprobados","Racionalización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con descomposiciones de tareas basadas en TDD","Creación de elementos de trabajo implementables para gerentes de proyecto y desarrolladores"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de tâches à partir de documents de conception approuvés","Rationalisation des flux de travail de développement avec des décompositions de tâches basées sur TDD","Création d''éléments de travail implementables pour les gestionnaires de projet et les développeurs"],"de":["Automatisierung der Aufgabengenerierung aus genehmigten Designdokumenten","Rationalisierung der Entwicklungsworkflows mit TDD-basierten Aufgabenzerlegungen","Erstellung implementierbarer Arbeitspunkte für Projektmanager und Entwickler"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de tarefas a partir de documentos de design aprovados","Otimizar os fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento com divisões de tarefas baseadas em TDD","Criar itens de trabalho implementáveis para gerentes de projeto e desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию задач из утвержденных документов дизайна","Упростить рабочие процессы разработки с помощью разбиений задач на основе TDD","Создавать реализуемые элементы работы для менеджеров проектов и разработчиков"],"ar":["تحويل تلقائي لإنشاء المهام من وثائق التصميم المعتمدة","تبسيط سير عمل التطوير باستخدام تقسيمات المهام القائمة على مبدأ TDD","إنشاء عناصر قابلة للتنفيذ للمدراء المشروع والمطورين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires approved design documents generated using /sdd-design","Design phase must be approved using sdd-approve design MCP tool","Dependent on sdd-status MCP tool for prerequisite verification"],"zh":["需要使用/sdd-design生成的批准设计文档","设计阶段必须使用sdd-approve设计MCP工具进行批准","依赖于sdd-status MCP工具进行前置条件验证"],"ja":["/sdd-designで生成された承認された設計文書が必要","設計段階はsdd-approveデザインMCPツールを使用して承認する必要がある","前提条件の検証のためにsdd-status MCPツールに依存する"],"ko":["sdd-design으로 생성된 승인된 설계 문서가 필요","설계 단계는 sdd-approve 설계 MCP 도구를 사용하여 승인해야 함","사전 조건 확인을 위해 sdd-status MCP 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere documentos de diseño aprobados generados utilizando /sdd-design","La fase de diseño debe ser aprobada utilizando la herramienta de diseño MCP sdd-approve","Depende de la herramienta MCP sdd-status para la verificación de prerequisitos"],"fr":["Nécessite des documents de conception approuvés générés en utilisant /sdd-design","La phase de conception doit être approuvée en utilisant l''outil de conception MCP sdd-approve","Dépend de l''outil MCP sdd-status pour la vérification des prérequis"],"de":["Benötigt genehmigte Designdokumente, die mit /sdd-design erstellt wurden","Die Designtphase muss mit dem Designtool MCP sdd-approve genehmigt werden","Hängt von dem MCP-Tool sdd-status für die Prüfung der Voraussetzungen ab"],"pt":["Exige documentos de design aprovados gerados usando /sdd-design","A fase de design deve ser aprovada usando a ferramenta de design MCP sdd-approve","Dependente da ferramenta MCP sdd-status para verificação de pré-requisitos"],"ru":["Требует утвержденных документов дизайна, сгенерированных с помощью /sdd-design","Фаза дизайна должна быть утверждена с помощью инструмента дизайна MCP sdd-approve","Зависит от инструмента MCP sdd-status для проверки предварительных требований"],"ar":["يتطلب وثائق تصميم معتمدة تم إنشاؤها باستخدام /sdd-design","يجب الموافقة على مرحلة التصميم باستخدام أداة التصميم MCP sdd-approve","يعتمد على أداة MCP sdd-status للتحقق من المتطلبات المسبقة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f2f59de25d8b290440a84f6f1202b1807c851b29a105ed03a2fec28951d1b0b3","qualityScore":42}');
