ext.js アプリを構築する際に従う原則とガイドラインであり、Server と Client コンポーネントの選択と使用を含みます","ko":"Next.js 최고의 실践은 Next.js 애플리케이션을 구축할 때 따르는 원칙과 가이드라인으로 Server 및 Client 컴포넌트의 선택 및 사용을 포함합니다","es":"Las mejores prácticas para Next.js son principios para desarrollar aplicaciones con el enrutador de Next.js, incluyendo el uso de componentes de servidor y cliente.","fr":"Les meilleures pratiques pour Next.js sont des principes pour développer des applications avec le routeur Next.js, y compris l''utilisation de composants serveur et client.","de":"Die Best Practices für Next.js sind Prinzipien für die Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit dem Next.js-Router, einschließlich der Verwendung von Server- und Client-Komponenten.","pt":"Next.js é uma estrutura JavaScript para criar aplicações web escaláveis com componentes do servidor e do cliente","ru":"Next.js - платформа JavaScript для создания масштабируемых веб-приложений с компонентами сервера и клиента","ar":"Next.js هي إطار جافاسكريبت لإنشاء تطبيقات ويب قابلة للتحجيم مع مكونات الخادم والعميل"},"features":{"en":["Decision tree for choosing between server and client components","Support for direct data fetching with server components","Ability to split components into server parent and client child for better interactivity","Use of ''use client'' directive for client components","Default server component usage for data fetching and layout","Client component usage for form handling and event handlers"],"zh":["Server 和 Client 组件的选择和使用","数据获取和静态内容的优化","表单处理和交互性","useState 和 useEffect 的使用","事件处理和客户端渲染"],"ja":["Server と Client コンポーネントの選択と使用","データ取得と静的コンテンツの最適化","フォーム処理とインタラクティブ性","useState と useEffect の使用","イベントハンドリングとクライアントサイドレンダリング"],"ko":["Server 및 Client 컴포넌트의 선택 및 사용","데이터 가져오기 및 정적 콘텐츠 최적화","폼 처리 및 상호 작용","useState 및 useEffect 사용","이벤트 처리 및 클라이언트 측 렌더링"],"es":["Uso de componentes de servidor y cliente con Next.js","Decision tree para determinar el tipo de componente","Uso de ''use client'' para componentes de cliente","Uso de componentes de servidor para fetching de datos","División de componentes en servidor y cliente para interactividad"],"fr":["Utilisation de composants serveur et client avec Next.js","Arbre de décision pour déterminer le type de composant","Utilisation de ''use client'' pour les composants client","Utilisation de composants serveur pour le fetching de données","Division de composants en serveur et client pour l''interactivité"],"de":["Verwendung von Server- und Client-Komponenten mit Next.js","Entscheidungsbaum zur Bestimmung des Komponententyps","Verwendung von ''use client'' für Client-Komponenten","Verwendung von Server-Komponenten für Datenfetching","Aufteilung von Komponenten in Server und Client für Interaktivität"],"pt":["Componentes do servidor e do cliente para otimizar o desempenho","Decision Tree para escolher entre componentes do servidor e do cliente","Suporte a useState, useEffect e event handlers","Otimização do desempenho da web com componentes do servidor","Criação de aplicações web escaláveis com Next.js"],"ru":["Компоненты сервера и клиента для оптимизации производительности","Decision Tree для выбора между компонентами сервера и клиента","Поддержка useState, useEffect и event handlers","Оптимизация производительности веб-приложений с помощью компонентов сервера","Создание масштабируемых веб-приложений с помощью Next.js и ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["مكونات الخادم والعميل لتحسين الأداء","شجرة القرار لاختيار بين مكونات الخادم والعميل","دعم useState و useEffect و event handlers","تحسين أداء الويب مع مكونات الخادم","إنشاء تطبيقات ويب قابلة للتحجيم مع Next.js"]},"keywords":{"en":["nextjs-best-practices tutorial","how to use nextjs-best-practices","nextjs-best-practices vs create-react-app","nextjs-best-practices setup guide","what is nextjs-best-practices","nextjs-best-practices alternative","nextjs-best-practices install","nextjs server component best practices","nextjs client component best practices","nextjs app router development"],"zh":["Next.js 最佳实践","Server 和 Client 组件","数据获取","静态内容","表单处理","useState","useEffect","事件处理","客户端渲染","Next.js 性能优化"],"ja":["Next.js ベストプラクティス","Server と Client コンポーネント","データ取得","静的コンテンツ","フォーム処理","useState","useEffect","イベントハンドリング","クライアントサイドレンダリング","Next.js パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["Next.js 최고의 실践","Server 및 Client 컴포넌트","데이터 가져오기","정적 콘텐츠","폼 처리","useState","useEffect","이벤트 처리","클라이언트 측 렌더링","Next.js 성능 최적화"],"es":["nextjs mejores prácticas","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Next.js","componentes de servidor y cliente","uso de ''use client''","fetching de datos con Next.js","creación de sitios web responsivos con Next.js"],"fr":["meilleures pratiques nextjs","développement d''applications avec Next.js","composants serveur et client","utilisation de ''use client''","fetching de données avec Next.js","création de sites web responsifs avec Next.js"],"de":["nextjs best practices","entwicklung von anwendungen mit Next.js","server- und client-komponenten","verwendung von ''use client''","datenfetching mit Next.js","erstellung von responsiven webseiten mit Next.js"],"pt":["next.js","componentes do servidor","componentes do cliente","desempenho da web","escalabilidade","decision tree","useState","useEffect","event handlers"],"ru":["next.js","компоненты сервера","компоненты клиента","производительность веб-приложений","масштабируемость","decision tree","useState","useEffect","event handlers","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["next.js","مكونات الخادم","مكونات العميل","أداء الويب","القدرة على التحجيم","شجرة القرار","useState","useEffect","event handlers"]}},"owner":"mjannino","repo":"travel-photos","repoPath":"mjannino/travel-photos","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.329Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nextjs-best-practices","description":"Next.js App Router principles. Server Components, data fetching, routing patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\n> Principles for Next.js App Router development.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Server vs Client Components\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nDoes it need...?\n│\n├── useState, useEffect, event handlers\n│   └── Client Component (''use client'')\n│\n├── Direct data fetching, no interactivity\n│   └── Server Component (default)\n│\n└── Both? \n    └── Split: Server parent + Client child\n```\n\n### By Default\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, layout, static content |\n| **Client** | Form","body":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\n> Principles for Next.js App Router development.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Server vs Client Components\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nDoes it need...?\n│\n├── useState, useEffect, event handlers\n│   └── Client Component (''use client'')\n│\n├── Direct data fetching, no interactivity\n│   └── Server Component (default)\n│\n└── Both? \n    └── Split: Server parent + Client child\n```\n\n### By Default\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, layout, static content |\n| **Client** | Forms, buttons, interactive UI |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Data Fetching Patterns\n\n### Fetch Strategy\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| **Default** | Static (cached at build) |\n| **Revalidate** | ISR (time-based refresh) |\n| **No-store** | Dynamic (every request) |\n\n### Data Flow\n\n| Source | Pattern |\n|--------|---------|\n| Database | Server Component fetch |\n| API | fetch with caching |\n| User input | Client state + server action |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Routing Principles\n\n### File Conventions\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `page.tsx` | Route UI |\n| `layout.tsx` | Shared layout |\n| `loading.tsx` | Loading state |\n| `error.tsx` | Error boundary |\n| `not-found.tsx` | 404 page |\n\n### Route Organization\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Route groups `(name)` | Organize without URL |\n| Parallel routes `@slot` | Multiple same-level pages |\n| Intercepting `(.)` | Modal overlays |\n\n---\n\n## 4. API Routes\n\n### Route Handlers\n\n| Method | Use |\n|--------|-----|\n| GET | Read data |\n| POST | Create data |\n| PUT/PATCH | Update data |\n| DELETE | Remove data |\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Validate input with Zod\n- Return proper status codes\n- Handle errors gracefully\n- Use Edge runtime when possible\n\n---\n\n## 5. Performance Principles\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n- Use next/image component\n- Set priority for above-fold\n- Provide blur placeholder\n- Use responsive sizes\n\n### Bundle Optimization\n\n- Dynamic imports for heavy components\n- Route-based code splitting (automatic)\n- Analyze with bundle analyzer\n\n---\n\n## 6. Metadata\n\n### Static vs Dynamic\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| Static export | Fixed metadata |\n| generateMetadata | Dynamic per-route |\n\n### Essential Tags\n\n- title (50-60 chars)\n- description (150-160 chars)\n- Open Graph images\n- Canonical URL\n\n---\n\n## 7. Caching Strategy\n\n### Cache Layers\n\n| Layer | Control |\n|-------|---------|\n| Request | fetch options |\n| Data | revalidate/tags |\n| Full route | route config |\n\n### Revalidation\n\n| Method | Use |\n|--------|-----|\n| Time-based | `revalidate: 60` |\n| On-demand | `revalidatePath/Tag` |\n| No cache | `no-store` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Server Actions\n\n### Use Cases\n\n- Form submissions\n- Data mutations\n- Revalidation triggers\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Mark with ''use server''\n- Validate all inputs\n- Return typed responses\n- Handle errors\n\n---\n\n## 9. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| ''use client'' everywhere | Server by default |\n| Fetch in client components | Fetch in server |\n| Skip loading states | Use loading.tsx |\n| Ignore error boundaries | Use error.tsx |\n| Large client bundles | Dynamic imports |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Project Structure\n\n```\napp/\n├── (marketing)/     # Route group\n│   └── page.tsx\n├── (dashboard)/\n│   ├── layout.tsx   # Dashboard layout\n│   └── page.tsx\n├── api/\n│   └── [resource]/\n│       └── route.ts\n└── components/\n    └── ui/\n```\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Server Components are the default for a reason. Start there, add client only when needed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:10.781Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient Next.js application development with optimized server and client component principles","zh":"非常适合需要高效Next.js应用开发的前端代理，能够优化服务器和客户端组件原则","ja":"Next.jsアプリケーション開発のための効率的なサーバーとクライアントコンポーネントの原則を最適化する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"효율적인 Next.js 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며 서버와 클라이언트 컴포넌트 원칙을 최적화 할 수 있다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan un desarrollo de aplicaciones Next.js eficiente con principios de componentes de servidor y cliente optimizados","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''un développement d''applications Next.js efficace avec des principes de composants serveur et client optimisés","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine effiziente Next.js-Anwendungsentwicklung mit optimierten Server- und Client-Komponentenprinzipien benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Frontend que necessitam de desenvolvimento de aplicativos Next.js eficientes com princípios de componentes de servidor e cliente otimizados","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходим эффективный разработка приложений Next.js с оптимизированными принципами серверных и клиентских компонентов","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير تطبيقات Next.js فعالة مع مبادئ مكونات الخادم والعميل المُحسنة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop high-performance Next.js applications by applying best practices for server and client components, utilizing techniques like direct data fetching and interactivity with ''use client'' and server components for layout and static content","zh":"通过应用服务器和客户端组件的最佳实践，利用直接数据获取和交互性等技术，例如使用''use client''和服务器组件进行布局和静态内容，从而使代理能够开发高性能的Next.js应用","ja":"サーバーとクライアントコンポーネントのベストプラクティスを適用し、直接データ取得やインタラクティブ性などのテクニックを利用することで、例えば''use client''とサーバーコンポーネントを使用してレイアウトや静的コンテンツを行うことで、エージェントが高パフォーマンスのNext.jsアプリケーションを開発できるようにする","ko":"서버와 클라이언트 컴포넌트에 대한 모범 사례를 적용하고 직접 데이터 가져오기 및 상호 작용성과 같은 기술을 사용함으로써, 예를 들어 ''use client'' 및 서버 컴포넌트를 사용하여 레이아웃 및 정적 콘텐츠를 수행하여 에이전트가 높은 성능의 Next.js 애플리케이션을 개발 할 수 있도록 한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones Next.js de alto rendimiento aplicando las mejores prácticas para componentes de servidor y cliente, utilizando técnicas como la recuperación directa de datos y la interactividad con ''use client'' y componentes de servidor para diseño y contenido estático","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications Next.js à haute performance en appliquant les meilleures pratiques pour les composants serveur et client, en utilisant des techniques comme la récupération directe de données et l''interactivité avec ''use client'' et des composants serveur pour la disposition et le contenu statique","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Next.js-Anwendungen mit hoher Leistung zu entwickeln, indem sie bewährte Methoden für Server- und Client-Komponenten anwenden, Techniken wie direktes Datenabrufen und Interaktivität mit ''use client'' und Server-Komponenten für Layout und statischen Inhalt verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver aplicações Next.js de alto desempenho aplicando as melhores práticas para componentes de servidor e cliente, utilizando técnicas como busca de dados direta e interatividade com ''use client'' e componentes de servidor para layout e conteúdo estático","ru":"Позволяет агентам разрабатывать высокопроизводительные приложения Next.js, применяя лучшие практики для серверных и клиентских компонентов, используя техники, такие как прямая выборка данных и интерактивность с ''use client'' и серверными компонентами для макета и статического контента","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تطوير تطبيقات Next.js عالية الأداء bằng تطبيق أفضل الممارسات لمكونات الخادم والعميل، باستخدام تقنيات مثل استرجاع البيانات المباشر والتفاعل مع ''use client'' ومكونات الخادم لتخطيط المحتوى الثابت"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing data fetching for Next.js applications","Implementing efficient server and client component archit